        <activityName xml:lang="en">Corrugated board, recycling fibre, double wall, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Corrugated board, recycling fibre, double wall, at plant
na;
UUID: f70905cc-8e9a-3e81-9bad-98e865f62a6a
This module includes the production of corrugated board out of the corrugated base papers. The following steps are included: energy production, corrugated board production itself, waste water treatment.; Geography: Average data from 6 Swiss corrugated board producers
Location: Average data from 6 Swiss corrugated board producers
Technology: Average of the used technology within the examined Swiss producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f70905cc-8e9a-3e81-9bad-98e865f62a6a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
